  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此數據包是為<strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a></span></strong>和<strong><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/solo-craft-reawakening\" rel=\"nofollow\">Solo Leveling: Reawakening</a></span></strong>之間的兼容性而創建</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>數據包的模塊版本 - <span style=\"color:#169179\"><a style=\"color:#169179\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/slr-ef-standard-target\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SLR Compat (標準版本)</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#169179\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#fff;text-decoration:underline\">數據包的擴展版是</span> <span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sl-r-and-epic-fight-compat-extended\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在這裏</a></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">我建議使用<span style=\"color:#843fa1\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#5f0087\"><strong><a style=\"color:#5f0087\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/solo-leveling-arsenal\" rel=\"nofollow\">Solo Leveling Arsenal</a></strong> </span></span>作為武器的3D模型</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">如果您對SL:R有任何問題：</span></strong>&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f36ejJENP74\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord (SL:R的官方Discord)</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#fff\">如何安裝： saves/your_world/datapacks</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ecf0f1\">快速修復以查看每日任務動畫：</span></strong><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1. 按 ESC - Modds</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2. 在搜索欄輸入：Epic fight</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">3. 按下 \\\"config\\\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">4. 然後點擊 \\\"Graphics\\\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">5. 過濾動畫：開</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#ecf0f1\">第一視角的快速修復</span></strong><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1. 按 ESC - Mods</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2. 在搜索欄輸入：Epic fight</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">3. 按下 \\\"config\\\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">4. 然後點擊 \\\"Graphics\\\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">5. 第一視角模型：關閉</span><br><br><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">將Epic fight戰鬥重新綁定到另一個按鈕 - 例如 f4。您仍然可以使用SLR技能的 \\\"R\\\" 按鈕</span></strong></span><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#fff\">在詢問之前出了什麼問題</span></strong><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1. 輸入： /datapack list</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2. 如果看不到數據包，請檢查 \\\"如何安裝\\\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">3. 重新加入世界並檢查</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br></span></span></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
